When nothing after `:=` fits on the statement line, the wrapper breaks
after `:=` and the right-hand side moves whole to a continuation line
(fmt.max_line_length break classes; the member chain is atomic,
fmt.atomic_property_chains).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE ReadSetting;
:DECLARE sConnectionDescriptor;
sConnectionDescriptor := oConfigurationManagerInstance:databaseConnectionSettings:primaryName;
:RETURN sConnectionDescriptor;
:ENDPROC;
